Here is a complete, self-contained HTML file for a pixel-perfect Space Invaders arcade game, recreating the classic 1978 experience.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Space Invaders · 1978 Taito</title>
  <style>
    /* Pixel-perfect CRT look */
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
    }
    body {
      background: #000;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
    .cabinet {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      border: 6px solid #0a0a1a;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 20px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,255,0,0.15);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .screen-wrapper {
      background: #0f0f0f;
      border: 4px solid #333;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 10px;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    canvas {
      display: block;
      background: #000;
      width: 560px;
      height: 480px;
      image-rendering: crisp-edges;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px #0f0;
    }
    .info-panel {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 12px;
      color: #f0f0f0;
      text-shadow: 0 0 4px #0f0;
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      background: #111;
      padding: 6px 20px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid #0f0;
